 466               /ASSEMBLED AT 7400. LOADED INTO 1220 INITIALLY. LOADS INTO
 467               /7400 VIA BOOTSTRAP.
 468               /READS IN FLD 1 PART FROM BLOCKS 35,36 THEN STARTS FLD1
 469               /BOOTSTRAP WHICH READS MONITOR HEAD FRDM BLOCK 37
 470               *1220
 471               NOPUNCH
 472               *7400
 473               ENPUNCH
 474                       SDSS=6771
 475                       SDST=6772
